FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: sortition.
OFF THE RECORD: counsel is assigned by lot. The lot is not appealable.
OFF THE RECORD: The draw is pushed to the dossier like any value, so it
OFF THE RECORD: survives crashes; a reenactment draws afresh, which the
OFF THE RECORD: spec admits out loud (see spec.md, the discretion note).

ARTICLE 1.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT counsel IS THE DISCRETION OF THE COURT BETWEEN 1 AND 6.
    PROCLAIM "Counsel number " PLUS THE TRANSCRIPT OF counsel PLUS " is assigned to your case.".
    PROCLAIM "Assigned on day " PLUS THE TRANSCRIPT OF THE DATE OF THESE PRESENTS PLUS " of the epoch.".
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.
